            <div xml:id="d801">

                <pb facs="0905" n="820" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg820"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867.48/1157: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bliss</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-01-23"><hi rendition="#italic">January 23,
                            1919</hi></date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 3.18
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>6893. Your telegram 6997, 16th, repeated from London relative to despatch of
                    three relief ships to Turkey.<anchor n="15" xml:id="d801-f1"/> Foreign Office
                    states that desired facilities will be given to the vessels and necessary
                    instructions issued to French High Commissioners at Constantinople and
                    Beirut.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bliss</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
